       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. LOOP.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-INDEX PIC 9(2) VALUE 1.
       01 WS-LIMIT PIC 9(2) VALUE 9.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       RUN-LOOP.
           PERFORM COUNT-PARA.
           ACCEPT WS-INDEX.
           SET WS-INDEX TO 1.
           IF WS-INDEX < WS-LIMIT THEN DISPLAY 'LOW' END-IF.
           STOP RUN.
